          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「芒に月＋菊に盃」「桜に幕＋菊に盃」を役として数えます。オフにすると菊に盃はタネ札としてだけ働きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Counts \"Moon (Pampas) + Sake Cup (Chrysanthemum)\" and \"Curtain (Cherry Blossom) + Sake Cup (Chrysanthemum)\" as yaku. When off, the Sake Cup only counts as an Animal card."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あがった人が次の局の親になります。流局のときは親が続きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whoever stops deals the next round. After a draw, the dealer stays the same."
          }
        }
      }
    },
